# Commands run by the launchd job com.annibale.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.airkernels).
#
# Every compute kernel of the corpus, dispatched on the Adreno (docs/air.md section 5).
# air_run waits on a fence, so a dispatch the GPU does not finish says so and exits
# non-zero rather than printing the buffer the harness filled itself.
#
# Nothing here says a kernel is right. There is no executed reference for these anywhere:
# softpipe runs 6 of the 47, so a number out of the Adreno has nothing on this machine to
# be compared against for the rest. Read the lines as finished or not, never as correct.
#
# The order is not cosmetic. Two kernels hang the GPU on their own -- measured on a fresh
# boot, each failing at the fourth dispatch: MetalFaceMask_GenerateToothMask
# (logs/190426-run.log, the list reversed) and fbs_bistochastize_iter
# (logs/190715-run.log, those kernels run first). After one hang this port's driver
# latches -- gpuWait in AnnibaleGPU.cpp returns false at once from then on -- so the rest
# of a boot is unmeasured rather than wrong. Both go last, where a hang costs least.
#
# MetalFaceMask_GenerateMask is NOT in that pair, though an earlier version of this file
# said so: it is only ever the first failure of a forward run, which is what any kernel at
# that position would be. Which of the other 22 hang on their own needs a boot each.
#
# A canary runs first and after every eight kernels: probe_one_scalar stores a constant to
# word 0 unconditionally, so when it stops writing the GPU has stopped answering. It needs
# EXTRA_SHARE to carry tools/air's probe modules; without them those lines fail to open a
# file and the rest of the list still runs.
#
# The first line is the shader M1 is stated against, with --disasm: it proves the GPU is
# there and that ir3 compiled what ran, which the screen's name alone does not.
#
/annibale/bin/air_run --disasm /System/Library/Extensions/AppleMetalGLRenderer.bundle/default.metallib clearFragment01
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitLumaKernel_Uint
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitChromaKernel_Uint
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitLumaKernel_UintPacked
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitChromaKernel_UintPacked
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitLumaKernel_Unorm
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitChromaKernel_Unorm
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib BlitKernel_Unorm
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainLumaKernel_Uint
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainChromaKernel_Uint
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainLumaKernel_Unorm
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/VideoDecoders/AV1SW.metallib FilmGrainChromaKernel_Unorm
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_Clear
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_InitMinMax
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_MinMax
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_CalcCubeInputScaling
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_PopulateCube
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_DilateCubeLuma
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_DilateCubeChroma1
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_DilateCubeChroma2
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_ErodeCubeLuma
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_ErodeCubeChroma1
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_ErodeCubeChroma2
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_InitSpanTable
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_GenerateMask
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_ConnectSpans
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_PropagateParents
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_PropogateAssociations
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_ResolveAssociations
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_DrawSpans
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_DrawEye
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_bistochastize_init
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_bistochastize_final
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_pcg_init
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_pcg_iter1
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_pcg_iter2
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_pcg_iter3
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_slice
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_slice_trilinear
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib spillCorrectionPreProcess
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib spillCorrectionPostProcess
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib image_calcminmax0
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib image_calcminmax1
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib image_calcminmax2
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib confidence
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_AddSeedPoint
/annibale/bin/air_run /annibale/share/probes/probe_one_scalar.bc
#
# the two measured as hanging on their own, last of all:
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib fbs_bistochastize_iter
/annibale/bin/air_run /System/Library/CoreImage/PortraitFilters.cifilter/default.metallib MetalFaceMask_GenerateToothMask
